<view class="page">
  <view class="page-head">
    <view class="page-eyebrow">离线工具 / 材料冲片计算</view>
    <view class="page-title">单次计算</view>
    <view class="page-desc">填写材料参数后计算预计圆片数量。每次计算都会自动写入本机历史记录，全部数据只保存在当前微信的本地缓存中。</view>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="section-head">
      <text class="section-title">材料参数</text>
      <text class="section-sub">{{parameterVersion}}</text>
    </view>

    <view class="row2">
      <view class="field">
        <text class="field-label">材质</text>
        <picker mode="selector" range="{{materialLabels}}" value="{{materialIndex}}" bindchange="onMaterialChange">
          <view class="picker-box">
            <text>{{materialLabels[materialIndex]}}</text>
            <text class="arrow">›</text>
          </view>
        </picker>
      </view>
      <view class="field">
        <text class="field-label">冲料方式</text>
        <picker mode="selector" range="{{modeLabels}}" value="{{modeIndex}}" bindchange="onModeChange">
          <view class="picker-box">
            <text>{{modeLabels[modeIndex]}}</text>
            <text class="arrow">›</text>
          </view>
        </picker>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="row2">
      <view class="field">
        <text class="field-label">厚度 <text class="unit">mm</text></text>
        <input class="input" type="digit" value="{{thickness}}" placeholder="例如 0.3" bindinput="onThicknessInput" />
      </view>
      <view class="field">
        <text class="field-label">宽度 <text class="unit">mm</text></text>
        <input class="input" type="digit" value="{{width}}" placeholder="例如 600" bindinput="onWidthInput" />
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="field">
      <text class="field-label">材料重量 <text class="unit">kg</text></text>
      <input class="input" type="digit" value="{{weight}}" placeholder="例如 100" bindinput="onWeightInput" />
    </view>

    <view class="field">
      <text class="field-label">数量采用的单重公式</text>
      <view class="choice-list">
        <view
          wx:for="{{formulas}}"
          wx:key="value"
          class="choice {{formula === item.value ? 'active' : ''}}"
          data-value="{{item.value}}"
          bindtap="onFormulaSelect"
        >
          <view class="choice-mark"></view>
          <view class="choice-body">
            <text class="choice-title">{{item.title}}</text>
            <text class="choice-desc">{{item.desc}}</text>
          </view>
        </view>
      </view>
      <view wx:if="{{modeIndex === 0}}" class="field-hint">第 3 套方片公式仅适用于单排。</view>
    </view>

    <button class="btn btn-primary btn-block" hover-class="btn-hover" bindtap="onCalculate">计算预计数量</button>

    <view wx:if="{{error}}" class="status is-error">{{error}}</view>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{result}}" class="card">
    <view class="result-hero">
      <text class="result-caption">预计圆片数量</text>
      <view class="result-value">
        <text class="result-number">{{result.quantityText}}</text>
        <text class="result-unit">个</text>
      </view>
      <text class="result-basis">{{result.basis}}</text>
    </view>

    <view wx:if="{{status}}" class="status {{statusError ? 'is-error' : ''}}">{{status}}</view>

    <view class="sub-title">本次输入</view>
    <view class="kv-grid">
      <view wx:for="{{result.inputPairs}}" wx:key="key" class="kv-item">
        <text class="kv-label">{{item.key}}</text>
        <text class="kv-value">{{item.value}}</text>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="divider"></view>

    <view class="sub-title">计算依据</view>
    <view class="kv-grid">
      <view wx:for="{{result.basisPairs}}" wx:key="key" class="kv-item {{item.wide ? 'kv-wide' : ''}}">
        <text class="kv-label">{{item.key}}</text>
        <text class="kv-value">{{item.value}}</text>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="btn-row">
      <button class="btn btn-secondary btn-small" hover-class="btn-hover" bindtap="onCopy">复制结果</button>
      <button class="btn btn-secondary btn-small" hover-class="btn-hover" bindtap="onExportCsv">导出 CSV</button>
      <button class="btn btn-secondary btn-small" hover-class="btn-hover" bindtap="onGoHistory">历史记录</button>
    </view>
  </view>
  <view wx:else class="card">
    <view class="empty">
      <text class="empty-symbol">◎</text>
      <text>填写上方参数，点击「计算预计数量」后在这里查看结果</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="note">
    <text class="note-title">计算说明</text>
    双排剪口先用宽度除以 1.87，单排直接取宽度；两种方式都将剪口向下取到 5 mm 的倍数。单重展示保留四位小数。单排第 3 套按方片单重用材料总重直接换算，不乘单排冲料圆片比例系数。角料重量 = 材料重量 × 角料比例系数（双排 0.12、单排 0.22），与所选单重公式无关，可在「参数维护」中调整。
  </view>

  <view class="footer-note">独立版 v1.1.0 · 计算模块提取自 MatManager 0.2.0 · 纯本机离线运行</view>
</view>
